q
0 0 384 146 re W n
[ 1 0 0 1 0 0 ] concat
  q
q
0 0 384 146 re W n
[ 611.760005 0 0 -791.75998 -109.335634 750.075766 ] concat
/cairo_ascii85_file currentfile /ASCII85Decode filter def
/DeviceRGB setcolorspace
<<
